data_tise2
# Phase identity: PyRITE crystal catalog entry [tise2].
# Bundled full-basis P1 CIF used by the declarative material catalog.
# Catalog provenance and assumptions:
# Ambient normal-state 1T-TiSe2 (P-3m1) has one TiSe2 formula unit per
# primitive cell. Vaterlaus, Helv. Phys. Acta 57, 884 (1984), Table 2.4,
# reports a=b=3.540 A, c=6.008 A, and Se z=0.25504. The weakly bonded
# Se-Ti-Se layers stack along c, so the catalog models a c-axis-normal slab.
# Limiting checks: V=(sqrt(3)/2)a^2c, 1Ti+2Se, and a finite (001) coupling.
# Validation: tise2-001-structure
_symmetry_space_group_name_H-M 'P 1'
_symmetry_Int_Tables_number 1
_cell_length_a 3.540
_cell_length_b 3.540
_cell_length_c 6.008
_cell_angle_alpha 90.0
_cell_angle_beta 90.0
_cell_angle_gamma 120.0
